function serviceHome(){const reader=service==='reader';return heading(reader?'OneReader':'OneMaths',reader?'A calmer place to read, discover and grow.':`Maths practice for Years 7–11 · ${esc(state.settings.board)}`,!student()?'<button data-view="planner">Schedule homework</button>':'')+(student()&&reader&&!progress('reading-check')?.complete?`<div class="notice"><h2>First, your reading check</h2><p>Five sections, ten questions each. Your answers save between sections. This classroom check helps suggest a starting level; it does not measure a standardised reading age.</p><button data-open="reading-check">Start reading check</button></div>`:'')+`<div class="grid three"><article class="card"><h2>${reader?'Reading library':'Topic library'}</h2><p>${catalog(reader?'book':'math').length} ${reader?'books, novels and transition guides':'topics with quizzes'}</p><button class="secondary" data-view="library">Explore ${reader?'books':'topics'}</button></article><article class="card"><h2>${reader?'Star Points':'Power Points'}</h2><p>${student()?`${state.awards.filter(a=>a.service===service).reduce((n,a)=>n+a.points,0)} earned so far`:'Track homework targets and progress by class.'}</p><button class="secondary" data-view="${student()?'homework':'reports'}">${student()?'My homework':'Class progress'}</button></article><article class="card"><h2>${reader?'Read your way':'Revision'}</h2><p>${reader?'Adjust text size, spacing and page colour while you read.':'Independent revision is available to Years 10–11.'}</p>${!reader&&student()&&state.student.year>=10?'<button class="secondary" data-view="library">Start revision</button>':''}${reader&&!student()?'<button class="secondary" data-view="reports">Reading checks & last login</button>':''}</article></div><section class="card space"><h2>${student()?'Your homework':'Recent homework'}</h2>${student()?studentTasks(service):taskList(state.tasks.filter(t=>t.service===service).slice(0,8))}</section>${reader?'<p class="footer">Full-length classics plus optional short reads · Suggested age groups are not measured reading ages. <a href="BOOK-SOURCES.txt">Book sources</a></p>':'<p class="footer">Original practice covering shared AQA/Edexcel GCSE topic areas. Not exam-board endorsed or a complete specification course.</p>'}`}
function studentTasks(svc){const tasks=state.tasks.filter(t=>!svc||t.service===svc);return tasks.length?tasks.map(t=>{const n=taskPoints(t,state.awards,state.student.id),pass=t.exempt||(state.passes||[]).some(p=>p.student_id===state.student.id&&p.task_id===t.id&&p.status==='approved');return `<div class="row"><div><h3>${esc(t.title)}</h3><p>${n} / ${t.points} ${t.service==='reader'?'Star':'Power'} Points · due ${fmt(t.due_at)}</p><small>${esc(cls(t.class_id))} · ${pass?(t.exempt?'Excused by teacher':'Homework pass approved'):n>=t.points?'Target reached':new Date(t.due_at)<new Date()?'Past due':'In progress'}</small>${t.feedback?'<p class="notice">Teacher feedback: '+esc(t.feedback)+'</p>':''}</div><button data-task="${esc(t.id)}">Open</button></div>`}).join(''):'<p>No published homework here yet.</p>'}

